 millions of people walk through their doors each day, have now used CM Viper Mats to protect their floor for many years.<\/p><p><\/p>","button_label":"View All CM Viper Entrance Mats","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/indoor-heated-mat","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"left","divider":false}},"text-and-image2":{"type":"text-and-image","custom_css":[".h1,h1 {font-size: calc(var(--typeHeaderSize) * 0.85); font-weight: bold; font-size: 22px;}"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/CM_Viper_Economy_Mats_1_8f76c34b-1cbf-4fbd-9290-b881c7eca46d.jpg","image_width":500,"subtitle":"SPECIALIZING IN CUSTOM WORK","title":"ENTRANCE MATS THAT FIT","text":"<p>Our team of professionals ensure that our mats can be made to fit the exact dimensions of your entrance. An oversized or undersized mats at your entrance can ruin the look of an impressive building, but our custom sized mats give it the perfect bespoke look.<\/p><p>Since we make them locally, we get your custom mats delivered fast!<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"right","divider":false}},"ee77d2cd-1d80-4938-9927-7f86cb9af736":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"template--14485921792129__ee77d2cd-1d80-4938-9927-7f86cb9af736-16793931756bdee2cd-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"Which CM Viper Economy Mat is right for you?"}},"template--14485921792129__ee77d2cd-1d80-4938-9927-7f86cb9af736-16793931756bdee2cd-1":{"type":"text","disabled":true,"settings":{"enlarge_text":true,"text":"<p>Use this text to share information about your brand with your customers. Describe a product, share announcements, or welcome customers to your store.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["template--14485921792129__ee77d2cd-1d80-4938-9927-7f86cb9af736-16793931756bdee2cd-0","template--14485921792129__ee77d2cd-1d80-4938-9927-7f86cb9af736-16793931756bdee2cd-1"],"settings":{"align_text":"center","narrow_column":true,"divider":false}},"61e831eb-594c-4604-b593-22eeececb052":{"type":"text-columns","blocks":{"template--14485921792129__61e831eb-594c-4604-b593-22eeececb052-1679382100c0d511da-0":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_33_42df462b-4fb7-4036-9693-57aef4c41a8a.png","image_width":510,"title":"CM VIPER RIB MATS","text":"<p>CM Viper Rib Entrance Mats are constructed of looped dual fibres arranged in a ribbed pattern to absorb moisture and scrape away dirt. These cost-effective mats are perfect for low to medium traffic areas.<\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$5.17\/sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"BUY VIPER RIB","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/cm-viper-rib-entrance-mats"}},"template--14485921792129__61e831eb-594c-4604-b593-22eeececb052-1679382100c0d511da-1":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_32_d259418a-84c8-4e2a-b6ee-bf3b376c57c2.png","image_width":650,"title":"VIPER 2500 NEEDLE-PIN MATS","text":"<p>Viper 2500 Needle-Pin Mats are made with a dual fibre Berber pattern that absorb moisture and scrape away dirt with its coarse yarns. With a durable PVC vinyl backing, these mats are perfect for moderate to low traffic areas.<\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$4.66\/sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"BUY VIPER 2500 NEEDLE PIN","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/viper-2500-stylepoint-entrance-mats"}},"template--14485921792129__61e831eb-594c-4604-b593-22eeececb052-1679382100c0d511da-2":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_30_f870b8a9-f9c0-48d8-81b4-d3ef67d0d193.png","image_width":500,"title":"PARQUET RIB MATS","text":"<p>These rubber backed and stitched polypropylene mats come in a molded 3' x 5' option. They come in a parquet rib pattern to add an element of design to your entrance area while keeping it clean and safe.<\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$4.66\/sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"BUY PARQUET RIB","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/parquet-rib-entrance-mats"}}},"block_order":["template--14485921792129__61e831eb-594c-4604-b593-22eeececb052-1679382100c0d511da-0","template--14485921792129__61e831eb-594c-4604-b593-22eeececb052-1679382100c0d511da-1","template--14485921792129__61e831eb-594c-4604-b593-22eeececb052-1679382100c0d511da-2"],"settings":{"title":"","align_text":"center","divider":false}},"00656917-4803-4483-a985-6be0cf7151d0":{"type":"featured-collection","settings":{"title":"TOP RATED CM VIPER MATS","home_featured_products":"indoor-outdoor-mats","per_row":5,"rows":4,"mobile_scrollable":true,"view_all":true,"divider":false}},"testimonials":{"type":"testimonials","blocks":{"testimonials-0":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"icon":"5-stars","testimonial":"<p>Add customer reviews and testimonials to showcase your store’s happy customers.<\/p>","author":"Author's name","author_info":"Los Angeles, CA"}},"testimonials-1":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"icon":"5-stars","testimonial":"<p>Add customer reviews and testimonials to showcase your store’s happy customers.<\/p>","author":"Author's name","author_info":"Los Angeles, CA"}},"testimonials-2":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"icon":"5-stars","testimonial":"<p>Add customer reviews and testimonials to showcase your store’s happy customers.<\/p>","author":"Author's name","author_info":"Los Angeles, CA"}}},"block_order":["testimonials-0","testimonials-1","testimonials-2"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"Testimonials","align_text":"center","round_images":true,"color_background":"#f9f9f9","color_text":"#1c1d1d"}},"ef57178d-0711-4f91-af4a-75caad7dd470":{"type":"promo-grid","blocks":{"template--14485921792129__ef57178d-0711-4f91-af4a-75caad7dd470-16793808214b868500-0":{"type":"advanced","settings":{"subheading":"","heading":"","textarea":"","cta_text1":"","cta_link1":"","cta_text2":"","cta_link2":"","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_image